{"seq":32,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T02:20:47.722Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ee17b691ac8b9a14e2e486794f6b1057bd0a669b33d857d5157a1e8c9750fc48","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, here's what I found for Vantorre Group (parent, excluding Mobility). I read #strategic-pod, #inc-vtg-hartford (you're a member of both), and all of Moss's Strategic digests in the team-strategic folder. Ticket numbers and account attributions come straight from those sources, and several of them conflict, so please check before this goes to Mateo.\n\n**Tickets**\n\n1. **#8841**, gate kiosk problem at Allentown Dock Door 12 (second shift)\n   - #strategic-pod, 1 Jul 2026, Gideon: \"I closed out ticket #8841 with support.\"\n   - Moss digest, 4 May 2026: still open for the Allentown Door 12 kiosk timeout.\n   - Moss digest, 30 Sep 2026: Mateo submitted #8841 about Newark Dock 14 not selectable on the check-in kiosk, escalated to platform engineering.\n   - **Conflict:** the status and the site differ across these three. Either the number was reused, or the ticket was reopened.\n\n2. **PD-8841**, missed carrier check-ins at Allentown (Gate 4, second shift)\n   - Moss digest, 27 Apr 2026.\n   - Not clear whether this is the same issue as #8841.\n\n3. **PD-4418**, `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export dropping timestamps at Dock Door 9\n   - Moss digest, 15 Sep 2025.\n   - The digest says \"the account Nadia runs\" and doesn't name Vantorre. I've treated it as Vantorre Group, but that's my inference.\n\n4. **INC-4821**, Hartford gate kiosks offline, and the status-page access problem\n   - #inc-vtg-hartford, 3 Aug 2026, Gideon at 11:08: screenshot attached to INC-4821, still chasing status-page access.\n\n5. **VT-55120**, root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage\n   - #inc-vtg-hartford, 14 Oct 2026, Gideon. I acknowledged it there the same day.\n\n**Left out**\n\n- #4812 is Vantorre Mobility (Moss digest, 10 Mar 2025).\n- PD-4402 is Quillfeather Outfitters.\n\n**Related but no ticket number given:** the 10 Mar 2025 gate check-in delays, the 3 May 2026 duplicate arrival entries (\"existing support thread\"), and the 3 Aug 2026 Hartford Sev 1 and duplicate check-in complaint. I haven't listed these as tickets.\n\nI didn't check the account ticket folders (`accounts/vantorre-group/tickets`), since you asked for the three sources only. If Mateo needs the full history, those are the next place to look."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
